// The pool — the programs a guest may be tonight.
//
// A CHARACTER with nothing but a name (no hooks, no beats, not `listed`)
// has no part in the story, so the app offers it on the guest sign-in
// picker instead of the performer one. Each is one guest's for the night:
// once claimed it is greyed out for everyone else. A guest who wants to be
// something not on this list searches the program directory (Wikipedia,
// software only — never antivirus) and gets that article's picture.
//
// Profile pictures are looked up by name in the same directory when the
// doors open; write `avatar: https://…` to choose one yourself.

CHARACTER Calculator
CHARACTER MS Paint
CHARACTER VLC
CHARACTER Ring Doorbell
CHARACTER WinZip
CHARACTER GarageBand
CHARACTER LimeWire
CHARACTER MSN Messenger
CHARACTER 3D Pinball
CHARACTER RollerCoaster Tycoon
CHARACTER Zoo Tycoon
CHARACTER Minesweeper
CHARACTER Ctrl Alt Del
CHARACTER Start Bar
CHARACTER Solitaire
CHARACTER Winamp
CHARACTER Napster
CHARACTER Encarta
CHARACTER Netscape Navigator
CHARACTER ICQ
CHARACTER The Sims
CHARACTER Notepad
CHARACTER Paint Shop Pro
CHARACTER RealPlayer
